r by searching for nodes connected to the Albedo and Emission ports.\r\n\r\n### Problem\r\nVoxelGI's lightmap baking only supported BaseMaterial3D, causing meshes with ShaderMaterial or VisualShader to be treated as white for albedo and black for emissive during bake. This prevented users from using custom shaders on objects that need baked lighting.\r\n\r\n### Solution\r\nExtended the Voxelizer to extract albedo and emission properties from ShaderMaterial and VisualShader materials by:\r\n\r\nFixes #114775\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Before </summary>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1981\" height=\"1179\" alt=\"imagen\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/908819ac-8ac9-4bc3-a133-62b6561d2af6\" />\r\nVoxelGI using default value for albedo (white) instead of the albedo texture from VisualShader\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>After (fixed)</summary>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1207\" height=\"830\" alt=\"imagen\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f692cb3d-0ccc-4e82-8c90-6c87f9576354\" />\r\nVoxelGI correctly baking albedo from VisualShader\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","